The ia64 linux kernel book website now provides a simple engine to
search the book for specific words or phrases.  You can find it at:

	http://www.lia64.org/book/search.php3

The search results do include brief quotations for the hits (one
quotation per page), but that's just intended to make it convenient to
judge whether the hit is relevant---you'll still need the book to take
full advantage of the results.

I plan to collect the search queries so that they can be used to
improve the quality of the printed index in future editions.

Enjoy,

	--david

